    "name": "Shrine Protectors",
    "steam_appid": 3679750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Play the demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/eee2ee233c0ad5dcbc81fd402ed0793c.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=260 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision-driven arrow combat</strong> \u2014 skill-based shooting where accuracy matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose powerful passive spells</strong> that grant bonuses and enhancements during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite progression</strong> with soldier leveling and meta upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple modes, including a hands-off AFK mode</strong> for idle play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct your soldiers </strong> as they hold the line and defend the shrine </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blend of arrow shooting and army management with rogue-lite depth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced action game, you\u2019ll need sharp aim and quick reflexes to survive waves of enemies. Every shot matters, master your bow to pierce through ever-tougher foes as the sun sets and the night grows deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/cea7a58e654b3c0751b5b2dc4caf6296.poster.avif?t=1750705522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/cea7a58e654b3c0751b5b2dc4caf6296.webm?t=1750705522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/cea7a58e654b3c0751b5b2dc4caf6296.mp4?t=1750705522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Auto Battler Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eendless mode where you can take a break a let your units do the work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/938bd6b8ade53f211f6927fdd810fe6b.poster.avif?t=1750705522\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/938bd6b8ade53f211f6927fdd810fe6b.webm?t=1750705522\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/938bd6b8ade53f211f6927fdd810fe6b.mp4?t=1750705522\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/3cf8d85070b186c8fe75472c836fec8f.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone. <strong>Recruit various unit types</strong> and command a supporting army of soldiers who fight at your side. Level them up, boost their strength and equip them with <strong>powerful items</strong> to customize their roles and turn the tide when things get overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/7490a2f61bd2a2b00021894f533b8a76.avif?t=1750705522\" width=800 height=784 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/0410e63ec857876d31ce867c7337c05d.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade an arsenal of passive spells, damage boosts, and unit upgrades. Experiment with new strategies on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/a69ca511254c1be130eed4ae0d6424da.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=691 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/7f3d8a22a5278db04d8b5bc24a1959ff.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple modes \u2014 tackle the challenge in a hands-on Active mode or switch to AFK mode to let your army fight on its own. Adjust the difficulty (Easy/Medium/Hard) to suit your preferred playstyle, from casual defense to hardcore survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/99d0320b9facfd81080d478752aa884f.avif?t=1750705522\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
