mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/a69ca511254c1be130eed4ae0d6424da.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=691 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/7f3d8a22a5278db04d8b5bc24a1959ff.avif?t=1750705522\" data-has-big width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple modes \u2014 tackle the challenge in a hands-on Active mode or switch to AFK mode to let your army fight on its own. Adjust the difficulty (Easy/Medium/Hard) to suit your preferred playstyle, from casual defense to hardcore survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679750/extras/99d0320b9facfd81080d478752aa884f.avif?t=1750705522\" width=800 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
